# http://localhost:5173 (and your real domain, once deployed) added under
# "Authorized JavaScript origins". Must match VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID in the
# frontend's root .env exactly — leave blank to have the API respond with a
# clear "not configured" message instead of erroring.
